"caps": [
{
"t0": 6.029,
"t1": 7.428,
"text": "You know these streets."
},
{
"t0": 7.428,
"t1": 10.044,
"text": "Now you can walk them, drive them, and even"
},
{
"t0": 10.044,
"t1": 12.599,
"text": "fly over them, in a free game built on the"
},
{
"t0": 12.599,
"t1": 14.166,
"text": "real map of Calgary."
},
{
"t0": 14.716,
"t1": 16.683,
"text": "It's called YYC City Stories."
},
{
"t0": 16.683,
"t1": 19.531,
"text": "It runs right in your web browser, with no"
},
{
"t0": 19.531,
"t1": 21.509,
"text": "download and no account."
},
{
"t0": 23.259,
"t1": 25.732,
"text": "Start with the map. The streets come from"
},
{
"t0": 25.732,
"t1": 28.386,
"text": "OpenStreetMap. The buildings, the parks, and"
},
{
"t0": 28.386,
"t1": 30.798,
"text": "even the shape of the ground mostly come"
},
{
"t0": 30.798,
"t1": 33.38,
"text": "from the City of Calgary's open data."
},
{
"t0": 33.93,
"t1": 36.117,
"text": "So when you drive down your own street, the"
},
{
"t0": 36.117,
"t1": 38.254,
"text": "homes are where they really are, fitted to"
},
{
"t0": 38.254,
"t1": 40.232,
"text": "their real footprint and height."
},
{
"t0": 40.782,
"t1": 43.677,
"text": "In and around downtown, the skyline is real"
},
{
"t0": 43.677,
"t1": 46.573,
"text": "too. Landmarks like Historic City Hall, The"
},
{
"t0": 46.573,
"t1": 49.468,
"text": "Bow, TELUS Sky and the Saddledome are built"
},
{
"t0": 49.468,
"t1": 51.623,
"text": "as their own detailed 3D models."
},
{
"t0": 51.623,
"t1": 54.519,
"text": "And the Calgary Tower stands right where it"
},
{
"t0": 54.519,
"t1": 55.34,
"text": "should."
},
{
"t0": 57.49,
"t1": 59.888,
"text": "But the skyline is only the beginning."
},
{
"t0": 59.888,
"t1": 62.32,
"text": "Wait until you see Stampede Park."
},
{
"t0": 62.87,
"t1": 65.283,
"text": "In this game, it's always Stampede time."
},
{
"t0": 65.283,
"t1": 67.695,
"text": "There's a midway with a Ferris wheel and"
},
{
"t0": 67.695,
"t1": 70.289,
"text": "food booths, the Grandstand Show, a country"
},
{
"t0": 70.289,
"t1": 72.991,
"text": "music stage, and fireworks every night."
},
{
"t0": 73.541,
"t1": 76.118,
"text": "Next to the Saddledome, there's a concert of"
},
{
"t0": 76.118,
"t1": 78.52,
"text": "the game's own title song, Under One Sky."
},
{
"t0": 78.52,
"t1": 81.272,
"text": "That's the song you're hearing right now."
},
{
"t0": 83.422,
"t1": 85.948,
"text": "Need to get around? Calgary Transit is in"
},
{
"t0": 85.948,
"t1": 88.351,
"text": "the game, with real bus routes and real"
},
{
"t0": 88.351,
"t1": 90.919,
"text": "stops from the City's own timetable."
},
{
"t0": 91.469,
"t1": 94.138,
"text": "Walk up to a stop, catch a bus, or ride the"
},
{
"t0": 94.138,
"t1": 96.558,
"text": "CTrain on the Red and Blue lines, right"
},
{
"t0": 96.558,
"t1": 97.963,
"text": "through downtown."
},
{
"t0": 98.513,
"t1": 101.176,
"text": "Now here's something a little different:"
},
{
"t0": 101.176,
"t1": 102.724,
"text": "real 311 requests."
},
{
"t0": 103.274,
"t1": 105.886,
"text": "Recent service requests from the City's open"
},
{
"t0": 105.886,
"t1": 108.498,
"text": "data show up as icons in the community where"
},
{
"t0": 108.498,
"t1": 111.11,
"text": "they were reported. Tap one to see what it's"
},
{
"t0": 111.11,
"t1": 113.544,
"text": "about, when it was reported, whether it's"
},
{
"t0": 113.544,
"t1": 115.912,
"text": "still open, and who's handling it."
},
{
"t0": 118.062,
"t1": 119.991,
"text": "And then, there are the stories."
},
{
"t0": 120.541,
"t1": 122.436,
"text": "Pick one of five characters."
},
{
"t0": 122.436,
"t1": 125.279,
"text": "Ali, who just landed at YYC to start a new"
},
{
"t0": 125.279,
"t1": 127.986,
"text": "life. Natalia, a high school student who"
},
{
"t0": 127.986,
"t1": 129.408,
"text": "stands up to bullies."
},
{
"t0": 129.408,
"t1": 131.912,
"text": "Chris, a seventy-two-year-old senior."
},
{
"t0": 131.912,
"t1": 134.89,
"text": "Jean, who has lived in Martindale for years."
},
{
"t0": 134.89,
"t1": 137.8,
"text": "And Leo, a visitor who arrives right in the"
},
{
"t0": 137.8,
"t1": 139.707,
"text": "middle of the Stampede."
},
{
"t0": 140.257,
"t1": 142.929,
"text": "Across twenty-seven missions, they learn how"
},
{
"t0": 142.929,
"t1": 144.266,
"text": "the city really works."
},
{
"t0": 144.266,
"t1": 145.845,
"text": "How to pay a transit fare."
},
{
"t0": 145.845,
"t1": 147.91,
"text": "Where newcomers can get free help."
},
{
"t0": 147.91,
"t1": 150.218,
"text": "What Fair Entry and the public library"
},
{
"t0": 150.218,
"t1": 150.932,
"text": "offer."
},
{
"t0": 151.482,
"t1": 153.863,
"text": "How to sort your black, blue and green"
},
{
"t0": 153.863,
"t1": 156.557,
"text": "carts. Why you clear your sidewalk after it"
},
{
"t0": 156.557,
"t1": 159.001,
"text": "snows. When to call Health Link at 811."
},
{
"t0": 159.001,
"t1": 160.792,
"text": "And how to spot a scam."
},
{
"t0": 161.342,
"t1": 163.537,
"text": "Natalia's story takes on bullying and"
},
{
"t0": 163.537,
"t1": 165.85,
"text": "cyberbullying, and it ends with a music"
},
{
"t0": 165.85,
"t1": 166.556,
"text": "video."
},
{
"t0": 167.106,
"t1": 169.108,
"text": "You can play in six languages:"
},
{
"t0": 169.108,
"t1": 171.976,
"text": "English, French, Punjabi, Urdu, Tagalog and"
},
{
"t0": 171.976,
"t1": 174.795,
"text": "Arabic, with voice lines in each one."
},
{
"t0": 175.345,
"t1": 177.789,
"text": "And when you just want to explore, there's"
},
{
"t0": 177.789,
"t1": 180.175,
"text": "free roam. Grab a car, call a helicopter,"
},
{
"t0": 180.175,
"t1": 182.445,
"text": "hunt for landmarks, or play online with"
},
{
"t0": 182.445,
"t1": 183.61,
"text": "other players."
},
{
"t0": 185.56,
"t1": 187.167,
"text": "So, is this GTA? No."
},
{
"t0": 187.167,
"t1": 190.463,
"text": "GTA 6 comes out tomorrow on PlayStation 5"
},
{
"t0": 190.463,
"t1": 192.392,
"text": "and Xbox Series X and S."
},
{
"t0": 192.392,
"t1": 195.233,
"text": "If you're playing it, have fun!"
},
{
"t0": 195.783,
"t1": 198.3,
"text": "YYC City Stories is something different:"
},
{
"t0": 198.3,
"t1": 200.566,
"text": "a small, free game about the city we"
},
{
"t0": 200.566,
"t1": 203.685,
"text": "actually live in. And you can play it today."
},
{
"t0": 204.835,
"t1": 208.065,
"text": "Play free at calgaryinsight.ca/game."
},
{
"t0": 208.615,
"t1": 210.694,
"text": "Which Calgary spot should we add next?"
},
{
"t0": 210.694,
"t1": 212.357,
"text": "Tell us in the comments."
},
{
"t0": 212.907,
"t1": 215.306,
"text": "Follow Calgary Insight on Facebook and"
},
{
"t0": 215.306,
"t1": 217.832,
"text": "Instagram, and subscribe on YouTube, for"
},
{
"t0": 217.832,
"t1": 219.508,
"text": "more Calgary stories."
}
],
